A||||6||JohnnyK||Loose motor mounts||||1||
Z||000000||JohnnyK||02-20-2001||07:00 PM||||I recently took my car to get safetied (failed), and they also said the motor mounts were loose. "Worn?" "Nope, just loose". Anyways (thanks for tightening them, you tards), where exactly, and how many are there? Not the top dogbone or anything. I guess this would also account for some rocking and banging of the engine, eh?||||reg||1
Z||000001||c m west||02-20-2001||07:10 PM||||there are 3 lower motor mounts in all ( front trans mount, rear trans mount, and front engine mount ) we can provide you with polyurathane mounts that will far outlast and out perform the factory replacement parts. Check us out at <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com." TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com.</A> <P>Eric - West Coast Fiero||||reg||1
